WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.510
A supervisor has to staff a mission
and see where the team is thin.

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:09.289
Nobody wants a hidden skills score,
and a résumé is a claim, not proof.

00:00:09.289 --> 00:00:13.462
Shellback shows only what people
confirmed and chose to share.

00:00:13.462 --> 00:00:15.886
Everyone in this video is fictional.

00:00:16.446 --> 00:00:17.648
Here is how it works.

00:00:17.648 --> 00:00:21.940
It all runs on this one computer:
a small PowerShell server

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:26.378
on loopback serves the app,
and the app runs in your browser.

00:00:27.078 --> 00:00:31.038
Your workspace is stored in the browser,
and exports can be encrypted.

00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:34.272
A résumé goes in as
pasted text, a text file,

00:00:34.272 --> 00:00:36.525
a Word file, or the text layer of a PDF.

00:00:36.525 --> 00:00:38.909
Peer cards and an HR
feed come in as files.

00:00:39.609 --> 00:00:40.000
Out come suggestions you confirm,
